  "reason": "Modify training_evaluation because PurchaseDataset.__getitem__ currently selects an arbitrary target and builds context from the entire history, including later purchases; prefix-only supervision directly tests the initial plan's training–inference mismatch hypothesis. Current macro validation HR@10 is 0.4462 versus SASRec's 0.5050, but a similar prefix-sampling experiment previously failed, so improvement remains uncertain. Historical profile corrections support checking supervision boundaries carefully while preserving architecture and optimization to isolate this change.",
